more" alt="" role="presentation"> after
==== blank-line-inside
[img]<br>
<a href="https://example.com/a.png" class="onebox" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow ugc">https://example.com/a.png</a><br><br>second paragraph<br>
[/img]
==== markdown-blocks-inside
[img]<h2><a name="heading-1" class="anchor" href="#heading-1" aria-label="Heading link"></a>Heading</h2>
<ul>
<li>one</li>
<li>two</li>
</ul>
<blockquote>
quoted<br>
[/img]</blockquote>
==== inline-markdown-inside
<img src="" alt="" role="presentation">
==== in-blockquote
<blockquote>
<img src="https://example.com/a.png" alt="" role="presentation"></blockquote>
==== in-list-item
<ul>
<li><img src="https://example.com/a.png" alt="" role="presentation"></li>
<li>next</li>
</ul>
==== in-table-cell
<div class="md-table">
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>head</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><img src="https://example.com/a.png" alt="" role="presentation"></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
==== in-heading
<h2><a name="imghttpsexamplecomapngimg-1" class="anchor" href="#imghttpsexamplecomapngimg-1" aria-label="Heading link"></a><img src="https://example.com/a.png" alt="" role="presentation"></h2>
==== around-b
<img src="" alt="" role="presentation">
==== in-b
<span class="bbcode-b">before <img src="https://example.com/a.png" alt="" role="presentation"> after</span>
==== in-core-quote
<aside class="quote no-group">
<blockquote>
<img src="https://example.com/a.png" alt="" role="presentation"></blockquote>
</aside>
==== misnested-with-i
<img src="" alt="" role="presentation"> tail[/i]
==== nested-in-itself
<img src="" alt="" role="presentation"> outer[/img]
==== repeated
<img src="" alt="" role="presentation"><img src="" alt="" role="presentation"> <img src="" alt="" role="presentation">
==== tail-and-next-line
<img src="https://example.com/a.png" alt="" role="presentation"> tail<br>
next line
==== blank-lines-around
before<br><br><br><img src="https://example.com/a.png" alt="" role="presentation"><br><br><br>after
==== unclosed
[img]<a href="https://example.com/a.png" class="inline-onebox-loading" rel="noopener nofollow ugc">https://example.com/a.png</a>
==== unmatched-close
<a href="https://example.com/a.png%5B/img%5D" class="onebox" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow ugc">https://example.com/a.png[/img]</a>
==== escaped
[img]<a href="https://example.com/a.png%5B/img%5D" class="inline-onebox-loading" rel="noopener nofollow ugc">https://example.com/a.png[/img]</a>
==== uppercase
<img src="https://example.com/a.png" alt="" role="presentation">
